# ─── Environment files ────────────────────────────────────────
# IMPORTANT: .env contains the WeatherAPI key. It will be set
# directly in Vercel's dashboard for the deployed build, so we
# keep it out of git history (which can be crawled / leaked).
# .env.example is committed as a template for new contributors.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

